ller machines; electronic point-of-sale payment alternatives; multiple account access options; online account opening platform; online banking with bill-pay and mobile banking capabilities, including mobile check deposit; online lending solutions for consumers and small businesses; customer service center services; an automated telephone banking system; and remote deposit capture and payroll services. Sierra Bancorp was founded in 1977 and is headquartered in Porterville, California.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Kevin J. McPhaill | President, CEO & Director | Age 52 | Compensation: $1.3M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 447 people. Revenue per employee of $347K ranks in the below the sector median among Financial Services peers, with revenue growing 6%/yr across its filed history. Each employee generates $72K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $5K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 4\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (4/10). Recent headlines include layoff or workforce-reduction announcements.","financial_summary":["Sierra Bancorp is a small-cap financial services business with a $547M market cap on $155M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +3% over the past three years and +7% annually across the full decade, which puts it in mature, slow-growth territory.","Returns on capital run at 8% against a 10% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The business throws off $32M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 21 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, with adequate 0.80\u00d7 cash conversion.","On the balance sheet, debt is heavy at 4.8\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and leverage like that is what turns a bad year into a permanent loss, and thin 1.1\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Management returns a meaningful 8.3% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insiders hold 11% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.3) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Trading near 52-week highs \u2014 the market has already recognised the story","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.22896698615548416},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $2.7M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Carries more leverage than most Financial Services peers \u2014 a smaller cushion for the inevitable bad year","sev":"amber","cat":"balance_sheet"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Recent layoff news \u2014 often the market\u2019s first signal that growth is under pressure or costs are being rebased","sev":"amber","cat":"news"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["27 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Preview and predictions: Semifinal, quarterfinal games of 2026 CIF Central Section football playoffs in Kern County, Bakersfield","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/preview-predictions-semifinal-quarterfinal-games-194301000.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794602018.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings","layoffs"]},{"title":"2027 GMC Sierra HD","source":"caranddriver.com","link":"https://www.caranddriver.com/gmc/sierra-2500hd-3500hd-2027","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794601528.319,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Sierra releases Poppy 1.0 as Shopify and Meta\u2019s Muse sign on","source":"thenextweb.com","link":"https://thenextweb.com/news/sierra-poppy-1-0-shopify-meta-muse-personal-agents","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794595065.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"HealthEx Joins Sierra\u2019s Personal Agent Protocol as a Design Partner","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/healthcare/articles/healthex-joins-sierra-personal-agent-170000244.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794589200.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.557,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Rain, snow, high winds in Reno-Tahoe forecast on Friday","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/rain-snow-high-winds-reno-153632000.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794584595.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":["guidance"]},{"title":"Figure Q3 Earnings Call Highlights Marketplace Growth and Kiavi Plans","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/figure-q3-earnings-call-highlights-134800429.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794577680.0,"origin":"tiingo","sen